msgid "not set"
msgstr "inte ställd"

msgid ""
"No RTC in\n"
"this bitstream.\n"
"\n"
"Enable `RTC in\n"
"rtl/boards.vh\n"
"then: make flash"
msgstr ""
"Ingen RTC i den\n"
"här bitströmmen.\n"
"\n"
"Slå på `RTC i\n"
"rtl/boards.vh,\n"
"sedan: make flash"

msgid ""
"A wall clock, analog or digital.\n"
"\n"
"Tab, arrows\tChoose Analog, Digital or Zone\n"
"Enter/Space\tPress it\n"
"z\tThe time zone: settings\n"
"\n"
"Or click the buttons. The time comes from the RTC, which net sets over NTP; until then it shows no time. The time zone is set in settings -- Zone opens it -- and shown under the digital time."
msgstr ""
"En väggklocka, analog eller digital.\n"
"\n"
"Tab, pilar\tVälj Analog, Digital eller Zon\n"
"Enter/Blanksteg\tTryck\n"
"z\tTidszonen: settings\n"
"\n"
"Eller klicka på knapparna. Tiden kommer från RTC:n, som net ställer via NTP; tills dess visas ingen tid. Tidszonen ställs in i settings -- Zon öppnar det -- och visas under den digitala tiden."

msgid "Clock help"
msgstr "Hjälp för clock"

msgid "Analog"
msgstr "Analog"

msgid "Digital"
msgstr "Digital"

msgid "Zone"
msgstr "Zon"
